/// Bounded poll of the wire-serve diagnostic trail for [needle] (the
/// server logs `client detached ...` when a frame stream ends). 3s cap —
/// the close handshake is loopback-fast even on starved CI runners.
Future<bool> _waitForDiagnostic(List<String> trail, String needle) async {
